    "source": "MISSION: SAFE.\nPLANT math.\nPLANT strings.\nPLANT lists.\n\n# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════\n#  Example 06 — BRAID: weaving lists together\n# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nROOT PASS_MARK TO 60.\n\n1\\ CREATE students(LIST) TO Alice, Bob, Carol, Dave, Eve.\n1\\ CREATE grades(LIST)   TO 92, 45, 78, 61, 55.\n1\\ CREATE subjects(LIST) TO Math, Science, English, History, Art.\n\n# ── 1. BRAID into pairs → iterate ─────────────────\n1\\ BRAID students WITH grades AS report.\n1\\ SHOW \"=== Grade Report ===\".\n\n1\\ CYCLE pair IN report,\n2\\   CREATE pname(TX) TO FIRST pair.\n2\\   CREATE pgrade(NUM) TO LAST pair.\n2\\   IF pgrade GREATER THAN OR EQUAL 90,\n3\\     SHOW pname + \" → \" + pgrade + \"  ★ Excellent\".\n2\\   ORIF pgrade GREATER THAN OR EQUAL PASS_MARK,\n3\\     SHOW pname + \" → \" + pgrade + \"  ✓ Pass\".\n2\\   ELSE,\n3\\     SHOW pname + \" → \" + pgrade + \"  ✗ Fail\".\n2\\.\n1\\.\n\n# ── 2. BRAID into MAP ─────────────────────────────\n1\\ BRAID subjects WITH grades AS subject_map MAP.\n1\\ SHOW \"\".\n1\\ SHOW \"=== By Subject ===\".\n1\\ SHOW \"Math    → \" + subject_map:\"Math\".\n1\\ SHOW \"Science → \" + subject_map:\"Science\".\n1\\ SHOW \"Art     → \" + subject_map:\"Art\".\n\n# ── 3. Stats ──────────────────────────────────────\n1\\ SHOW \"\".\n1\\ SHOW \"=== Statistics ===\".\n1\\ REAP avg FROM lists:AVERAGE, grades.\n1\\ SHOW \"Average : \" + avg.\n1\\ SHOW \"Highest : \" + MAX grades.\n1\\ SHOW \"Lowest  : \" + MIN grades.\n1\\ SHOW \"Students: \" + COUNT grades.\n\n# ── 4. Split into pass / fail lists ───────────────\n1\\ CREATE passing(LIST) TO.\n1\\ CREATE failing(LIST) TO.\n\n1\\ CYCLE pair IN report,\n2\\   CREATE pname(TX) TO FIRST pair.\n2\\   CREATE pgrade(NUM) TO LAST pair.\n2\\   IF pgrade GREATER THAN OR EQUAL PASS_MARK,\n3\\     PUT pname INTO passing.\n2\\   ELSE,\n3\\     PUT pname INTO failing.\n1\\.\n\n1\\ SHOW \"\".\n1\\ SHOW \"Passing (\" + COUNT passing + \"): \" + FIRST passing + \" ... \" + LAST passing.\n1\\ SHOW \"Failing (\" + COUNT failing + \"):\".\n1\\ CYCLE name IN failing,\n2\\   SHOW \"  ✗ \" + name + \" needs support\".\n1\\.\n"
